---
source: shorwatch-report/src/sarif.rs
expression: render(&scan())
---
{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "Shorwatch",
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/ErwinQuantum/shorwatch",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "config.spring-boot.jose-rsa",
              "name": "RSA (JOSE/JWT)",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "RSA (JOSE/JWT) is broken by Shor's algorithm"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "RSA (JOSE/JWT) usage detected."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Plan a protocol migration to ML-KEM (FIPS 203) for key establishment and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) for signatures; hybrid schemes keep classical security during the transition.",
                "markdown": "Plan a protocol migration to ML-KEM (FIPS 203) for key establishment and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) for signatures; hybrid schemes keep classical security during the transition.\n\n**References**\n\n- [FIPS 203: ML-KEM](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/203/final)\n- [FIPS 204: ML-DSA](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/204/final)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/203/final",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "cryptography",
                  "post-quantum",
                  "shor"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "precision": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "jvm.jca.aes-128",
              "name": "AES-128",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "AES-128 keeps only about 64 bits of security against Grover's algorithm"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A 128-bit AES key detected."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Use 256-bit keys (AES-256).",
                "markdown": "Use 256-bit keys (AES-256).\n\n**References**\n\n- [FIPS 197: AES](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/197/final)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/197/final",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "note"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "cryptography",
                  "post-quantum",
                  "grover"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.0",
                "precision": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "jvm.jca.ecdsa",
              "name": "ECDSA",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "ECDSA is broken by Shor's algorithm"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "ECDSA usage detected."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Plan a protocol migration to ML-KEM (FIPS 203) for key establishment and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) for signatures; hybrid schemes keep classical security during the transition.",
                "markdown": "Plan a protocol migration to ML-KEM (FIPS 203) for key establishment and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) for signatures; hybrid schemes keep classical security during the transition.\n\n**References**\n\n- [FIPS 203: ML-KEM](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/203/final)\n- [FIPS 204: ML-DSA](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/204/final)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/203/final",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "cryptography",
                  "post-quantum",
                  "shor"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "precision": "high"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "jvm.jca.rsa",
              "name": "RSA",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "RSA is broken by Shor's algorithm"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "RSA usage detected."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Plan a protocol migration to ML-KEM (FIPS 203) for key establishment and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) for signatures; hybrid schemes keep classical security during the transition.",
                "markdown": "Plan a protocol migration to ML-KEM (FIPS 203) for key establishment and ML-DSA (FIPS 204) for signatures; hybrid schemes keep classical security during the transition.\n\n**References**\n\n- [FIPS 203: ML-KEM](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/203/final)\n- [FIPS 204: ML-DSA](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/204/final)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/203/final",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "cryptography",
                  "post-quantum",
                  "shor"
                ],
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "precision": "high"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "columnKind": "unicodeCodePoints",
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "jvm.jca.rsa",
          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "RSA usage detected."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/main/java/com/acme/auth/AuthConfig.java",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 5,
                  "startColumn": 25,
                  "endLine": 5,
                  "endColumn": 60
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "algorithm": "RSA",
            "status": "vulnerable",
            "role": "production"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "jvm.jca.aes-128",
          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "A 128-bit AES key detected."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/main/java/com/acme/auth/AuthConfig.java",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 11,
                  "startColumn": 2,
                  "endLine": 11,
                  "endColumn": 21
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "fixes": [
            {
              "description": {
                "text": "Use a 256-bit AES key"
              },
              "artifactChanges": [
                {
                  "artifactLocation": {
                    "uri": "src/main/java/com/acme/auth/AuthConfig.java",
                    "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                  },
                  "replacements": [
                    {
                      "deletedRegion": {
                        "startLine": 11,
                        "startColumn": 17,
                        "endLine": 11,
                        "endColumn": 20
                      },
                      "insertedContent": {
                        "text": "256"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "algorithm": "AES-128",
            "status": "vulnerable",
            "role": "production"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "jvm.jca.ecdsa",
          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "ECDSA usage detected. In transition: post-quantum code at line 3 (ML-DSA-65)."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/main/java/com/acme/auth/Signer.java",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 3,
                  "startColumn": 34,
                  "endLine": 3,
                  "endColumn": 75
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "algorithm": "ECDSA",
            "status": "in transition",
            "role": "production"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "config.spring-boot.jose-rsa",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "RSA (JOSE/JWT) usage detected."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/main/resources/application.yml",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 4,
                  "startColumn": 24,
                  "endLine": 4,
                  "endColumn": 29
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "algorithm": "RSA (JOSE/JWT)",
            "status": "vulnerable",
            "role": "production"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "jvm.jca.rsa",
          "ruleIndex": 3,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "RSA usage detected."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/test/java/com/acme/auth/SignerTest.java",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 3,
                  "startColumn": 16,
                  "endLine": 3,
                  "endColumn": 58
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "algorithm": "RSA",
            "status": "vulnerable",
            "role": "test",
            "tags": [
              "test"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
